### Assets

- `compass-deploy-v*.tar.gz` — online deploy bundle
- `compass-offline-v*.tar.gz` — offline (air-gapped) deploy bundle (where applicable)
- `compass-setup.sh` — online installer entry-point
- `*.sig` + `*.cert` — cosign keyless signatures (Sigstore Fulcio / Rekor)
- `*.cdx.json` — CycloneDX SBOM generated from unpacked tarball contents (also signed)
- `*.sha256` — original checksums from the source release
